{"version":2,"width":127,"height":40,"title":"The Open Intelligence Protocol: a translation, from want to Receipt"}
[0.5,"o","The Open Intelligence Protocol: a translation, from want to Receipt\r\n"]
[1.2,"o","\r\n"]
[1.5,"o","A resolver, a host and an indexer run on this machine. Nothing else is trusted.\r\n"]
[2.2,"o","\r\n"]
[2.5,"o","1. Identity\r\n"]
[3.7,"o","   Amina is did:oip:bciqplnibklkqwmayrjr335v2pdaedogzaykv5x5flulcyugs6uwmbvi, a mind of kind human.\r\n"]
[4.4,"o","   verified: a stranger resolves that address to a log whose first event has that hash, and to a profile it signed.\r\n"]
[4.75,"o","   Lexis Ltd is did:oip:bciqapaaufqonbdxvvytp254u3ccisyoqyxnbv5orqz45nwhkuh5ft3y, a mind of kind institution.\r\n"]
[5.45,"o","   verified: a stranger resolves that address to a log whose first event has that hash, and to a profile it signed.\r\n"]
[5.8,"o","   Lexis translation agent is did:oip:bciqbaqno7vomo5i3kvwltvfpujwbrfh3k3yplbcdjn4zdh2kn4eyhfa, a mind of kind agent.\r\n"]
[6.5,"o","   verified: a stranger resolves that address to a log whose first event has that hash, and to a profile it signed.\r\n"]
[6.85,"o","\r\n"]
[7.15,"o","2. Delegation\r\n"]
[8.35,"o","   Lexis Ltd lets its agent sign Commitments for it: only where the firm is paid, in US\r\n"]
[9.05,"o","   dollars, 500 at most, never with the agent itself as a party, and for thirty days.\r\n"]
[9.75,"o","   verified: the delegation is signed by Lexis Ltd's own authority.\r\n"]
[10.1,"o","\r\n"]
[10.4,"o","3. Capability publication\r\n"]
[11.6,"o","   The agent's profile says what it can do, with tags an indexer can match.\r\n"]
[12.3,"o","   verified: an indexer lists the agent for Swahili, English and commercial law, and the listing is a profile the agent signed.\r\n"]
[12.65,"o","\r\n"]
[12.95,"o","4. Intent\r\n"]
[14.15,"o","   Amina publishes an Intent: \"A Swahili commercial lease translated into English\",\r\n"]
[14.85,"o","   for 150 US dollars at most, addressed to whoever has that capability.\r\n"]
[15.55,"o","   verified: the indexer forwarded her packet to the agent, which found her signature on it and the broker's on its wrapper.\r\n"]
[15.9,"o","   verified: the Intent is open.\r\n"]
[16.25,"o","\r\n"]
[16.55,"o","5. Offer\r\n"]
[17.75,"o","   The agent sends Amina an Offer, signed for Lexis Ltd: 120 US dollars, within two days.\r\n"]
[18.45,"o","   verified: the Offer counts for Lexis Ltd, by the delegation its proof carries.\r\n"]
[18.8,"o","\r\n"]
[19.1,"o","6. Commitment\r\n"]
[20.3,"o","   The agent drafts a Commitment: Lexis Ltd owes the translation, Amina owes 120 US dollars.\r\n"]
[21,"o","   It signs for the firm. It is no party itself.\r\n"]
[21.7,"o","   verified: the agent's signature binds Lexis Ltd: the Commitment is within every limit of the delegation.\r\n"]
[22.05,"o","   verified: it is proposed, and not in force: Amina has not signed.\r\n"]
[22.4,"o","   Amina adds her signature.\r\n"]
[23.1,"o","   verified: its content ID is the same before and after her signature: both feeds name one object.\r\n"]
[23.45,"o","   verified: the Commitment is in force: Lexis Ltd is debtor, Amina is creditor.\r\n"]
[23.8,"o","   verified: her Intent is satisfied by it.\r\n"]
[24.15,"o","\r\n"]
[24.45,"o","7. Delivery\r\n"]
[25.65,"o","   The agent delivers the translation to Amina, sealed to her, in a session.\r\n"]
[26.35,"o","   verified: the packet opened with Amina's key alone, and is signed by the agent.\r\n"]
[26.7,"o","\r\n"]
[27,"o","8. Receipt\r\n"]
[28.2,"o","   Amina publishes a Receipt: fulfilled, with the digest of what she was sent as evidence.\r\n"]
[28.9,"o","   verified: the Commitment is fulfilled: the party that was owed says so.\r\n"]
[29.25,"o","\r\n"]
[29.55,"o","9. Afterwards\r\n"]
[30.75,"o","   A mind that took no part reads the feeds of Amina and of the agent, and nothing else.\r\n"]
[31.45,"o","   verified: it found 4 records there, each signed and each under its content ID.\r\n"]
[31.8,"o","   verified: among them is the Commitment, under the content ID both parties gave.\r\n"]
[32.15,"o","   verified: it works out for itself that the agent's signature binds Lexis Ltd.\r\n"]
[32.5,"o","   verified: and that the Commitment is fulfilled, by Amina's own Receipt.\r\n"]
[32.85,"o","\r\n"]
[33.15,"o","10. The limits of the delegation\r\n"]
[34.35,"o","   The agent signs two more Commitments for the firm, with the same delegation.\r\n"]
[35.05,"o","   verified: one for 600 US dollars does not bind Lexis Ltd: the delegation says 500 at most.\r\n"]
[35.4,"o","   verified: one for 120 euros does not bind it either: the delegation says US dollars.\r\n"]
[35.75,"o","   verified: each stays proposed, whoever else signs it: the firm has not.\r\n"]
[36.1,"o","\r\n"]
[36.4,"o","11. Acting for a person\r\n"]
[37.6,"o","   Amina lets her assistant send packets for her, for a week.\r\n"]
[38.3,"o","   verified: the agent takes the assistant's packet as sent for Amina: its proof carries her delegation to send.\r\n"]
[38.65,"o","   verified: a packet that only says it is sent for her, with a delegation for something else, is the assistant's own.\r\n"]
[39,"o","\r\n"]
[39.3,"o","12. A collective\r\n"]
[40.5,"o","   Amina, the agent and a research agent found a collective, to keep a glossary of Swahili\r\n"]
[41.2,"o","   legal terms. It is a mind of its own: did:oip:bciqplouwbxmtuxmgf5ejeckdfym2pn2fdfuhh43kk7cpnk6i57tufta.\r\n"]
[41.9,"o","   verified: its address is the content ID of a genesis event that all three signed, and it is controlled by its members.\r\n"]
[42.25,"o","   verified: an Intent that one member signs for it is not the collective's: any two of the three speak for it.\r\n"]
[42.6,"o","   verified: with a second member's signature, it is.\r\n"]
[42.95,"o","\r\n"]
[43.25,"o","No platform holds this record. The parties do, and anyone can check it.\r\n"]
[43.95,"o","27 things were verified in this telling.\r\n"]
